name is-bst
category Package
revision 52623
shortdesc Extended versions of standard BibTeX styles
longdesc The bundle contains an extended version (xbtxbst.doc) of the
longdesc source of the standard BibTeX styles, together with
longdesc corresponding versions of the standard styles. The styles offer
longdesc support for CODEN, ISBN, ISSN, LCCN, and PRICE fields, extended
longdesc PAGES fields, the PERIODICAL entry, and extended citation label
longdesc suffixing.
